cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use s3e in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "s3e: A Python library for probabilistic symbolic state estimation with vision-language models"
abstract: >-
  s3e estimates the truth values of grounded PDDL predicates from images using
  vision-language models, reading answer-token probabilities instead of parsing
  generated text, with pluggable HuggingFace, vLLM, and OpenAI backends and
  offline Platt-scaling calibration.
